	\L_00eac:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'The Kaiju Prince and Princess'
	R
	'were before the throne at'
	R
	'Rance’s order.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Leazas’s King Rance...'
	R
	'Is there something you...?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 255!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyaaah, Your Majesty!'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00eac:
	ZH 1:
	'The Kaiju Princess sat on the'
	R
	'throne’s armrest.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'Hey, what are you doing?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Um, that magicvision thing in'
	R
	'our room is really cool.'
	R
	'I want it, gyah.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'Gahahahahaha.'
	R
	'I’ll give it to you, then.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Really?'
	R
	'I’m so glad.'
	R
	'Eheh, gyah.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00eac:
	ZH 1:
	'The Kaiju Princess kissed'
	R
	'Rance on the cheek.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 499!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah!'
	R
	'Don’t be so improper!'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 255!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, it’s fine.'
	R
	'I’m already an adult.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'Not yet you’re not.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyaaaah...?'
	R
	'Why?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'My hyper weapon isn’t reacting'
	R
	'to you. That means you’re a'
	R
	'child.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyaaah!'
	R
	'I’m an adult, though!'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'14 years old...'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'How old would be good, then?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'15 and up.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, that doesn’t matter!'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh, but it does.'
	R
	'That difference of one year is'
	R
	'huge.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 499!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, control yourself.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 255!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyaaaaahn!'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00eac:
	ZH 1:
	'The Kaiju Prince picked up the'
	R
	'Kaiju Princess and brought her'
	R
	'back to her original spot.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 499!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, Leazas’s King Rance.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'I have a request for you.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'What?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Would you allow us to build a'
	R
	'bronze statue of you in'
	R
	'Shangri-La as a symbol of our'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'respect towards you?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'A bronze statue, huh...?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, does the idea not tickle'
	R
	'your fancy?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'No, I just want it to be a'
	R
	'gold statue. A huge one.'
	R
	'Gahahahahaha.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 255!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Kyahahaha.'
	R
	'You must love throwing money'
	R
	'around, Your Majesty.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 499!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, stop it.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'I’m not just throwing money'
	R
	'around.'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'The bigger a symbol of my'
	R
	'power is, the better it'
	R
	'expresses my greatness.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, I see...'
	R
	'I had the wrong idea of what a'
	R
	'great king is.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'Gahahahahaha.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Then allow me to build a gold'
	R
	'statue of you in Shangri-La.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'Mhm, do what you think is best.'
	R
	'Gahahahaha.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00eac:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance was in a good mood.'
