	\L_00f38:
	\L_00eac:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　Leazas Castle'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　　　　　Audience Room'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'Maris came before Rance, a'
	R
	'strange look on her face.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'What is it?'
	R
	'You’re making a pretty dumb'
	R
	'face...'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'King Rance...'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah, what?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'We have visitors from'
	R
	'Shangri-La, but...'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'Shangri-La...??'
	R
	'Huh... Is it Housesnurse??'
	R
	'Nah, that can’t be...'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Shall I allow them through?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'Mm...'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, let them pass.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e90:
	ZH 1:
	'What am I gonna do if it’s'
	R
	'that pig Descoco’s ghost...?'
	R
	'My heart’s racing...'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	\L_00eac:
	ZH 1:
	'The visitors from Shangri-La'
	R
	'came before Rance.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	!VAR0516 : 499!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, it’s an honor to be'
	R
	'allowed to see you, Leazas’s'
	R
	'King Rance.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 255!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, hello, Your Majesty.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'...Huh??'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00eac:
	ZH 1:
	'Rance looked at the strangely'
	R
	'polite beings in front of him'
	R
	'and slid out of his chair.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'...Lizards??'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'No... The girl behind him'
	R
	'looks human, but...'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 499!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah... We’re neither man nor'
	R
	'lizard. I am the Kaiju Prince.'
	R
	'The one behind me is...'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 255!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, the Prince’s sister, the'
	R
	'Kaiju Princess. Uhu.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00eac:
	ZH 1:
	'The Kaiju Princess winked at'
	R
	'Rance.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 499!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, stop that.'
	R
	'It’s improper...'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 255!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, it’s fine... Whatever...'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'...I get that you two are'
	R
	'siblings...'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'But... You say you came from'
	R
	'Shangri-La? What do you mean?'
	R
	'Explain.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 499!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, yes, King Rance.'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'The truth is, we aren’t of'
	R
	'this world.'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'We came here from another'
	R
	'dimension, seeking a new land.'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'Our chance to come to this'
	R
	'world came during our land’s'
	R
	'Kaiju Priests’ prayers...'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'They happened to call up a'
	R
	'conversation with Ms.'
	R
	'Housesnurse.'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'We live in deserts, gyah.'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'We wanted our new world to be'
	R
	'one where we could function'
	R
	'with a desert at its center.'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'This world was ideal for us, so'
	R
	'with the Kaiju Priests and'
	R
	'Housesnurse’s power combined,'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'we made a path to this world.'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'And then we came to Shangri-La,'
	R
	'gyah.'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'Then we heard that Shangri-La’s'
	R
	'King, Leazas’s King Rance was'
	R
	'fighting to unite the world..'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'We hope to join your war and'
	R
	'be of use to you, however'
	R
	'meager our abilities...'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'Dependent on our meeting with'
	R
	'you, gyah.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00eac:
	ZH 1:
	'The Kaiju Prince gave a smooth'
	R
	'answer and gracefully lowered'
	R
	'his head.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'...Are you strong?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'I would not wish to be uncouth,'
	R
	'but...'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 255!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah, he’s strong.'
	R
	'Aren’t you?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 499!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, you need to lower your'
	R
	'head too.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 255!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Bah, gyah!'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, got it.'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'I guess you came from another'
	R
	'dimension, but if Housesnurse'
	R
	'referred you here,'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'then I’ll use you.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 499!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, thank you very much.'
	R
	'It’s an honor.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'By the way...'
	R
	'Can your sister fight?'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 255!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, me and my brother are a'
	R
	'set.'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'I don’t like fighting, but if'
	R
	'my brother’s going to war, I'
	R
	'will too.'
	\L_00f99:
	ZH 1:
	'I don’t wanna be separated'
	R
	'from my brother.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00e74:
	ZH 1:
	'Alright, got it.'
	R
	'Then I’ll recognize you two as'
	R
	'my subordinates.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 499!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, thank you very much.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 255!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00ee4:
	ZH 1:
	'Gyah, yeah, Your Majesty.'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00f46:
	!VAR0516 : 6!
	\L_00f38:
	\L_00f00:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah... More strange characters'
	R
	'are living in Leazas Castle...'
	\L_00f99:
	\L_00f8c:
	\L_00eac:
	ZH 1:
	'Thus, the Kaiju Prince and'
	R
	'Kaiju Princess joined Rance.'
